    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think i want to let the silence sit with me. it just feels like it's suffocating me. sometimes i sit there thinking about how much easier it would be if i just didn't have to carry this anymore. if i could just... go where he went. it feels like the only way to actually find any peace is to stop fighting it all. does that sound crazy? that I just want to be with him?",
